{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"scriptorium","model_identifier":"scriptorium","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# scriptorium\n\nScriptorium: a stone building with tall arched windows and a square book tower whose upper room is lined with shelves of coloured books (seen through the windows).\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 8 columns (160 x 128 units, 4.50 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -78..73, y 0..212, z -28..52 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 69, construction_0 26, construction_33 42, construction_66 55, ruined 40 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hall: 96 x 140 x 72 centred at x -24, z 12\n- book tower: 48 x 214 x 48 at x 48, z 12\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `scriptorium_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `scriptorium_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_scriptorium` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-24, 0, -33)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"scr_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-74.0,0.0,-26.0],"to":[26.0,3.0,50.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[108.0,323.0,208.0,326.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[208.0,323.0,284.0,326.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[108.0,323.0,208.0,326.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[208.0,323.0,284.0,326.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[321.0,0.0,421.0,76.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[321.0,0.0,421.0,76.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"b08b3eeb-dd5c-57d9-affd-96d86eb271bd"},{"name":"scr_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-72.0,3.0,-24.0],"to":[24.0,99.0,-20.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[102.0,0.0,198.0,96.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[262.0,0.0,266.0,96.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[102.0,0.0,198.0,96.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[262.0,0.0,266.0,96.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[38.0,310.0,134.0,314.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[38.0,310.0,134.0,314.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d3ec56cd-ca5f-562a-bb6a-ad5395c50b5c"},{"name":"scr_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-72.0,3.0,44.0],"to":[24.0,99.0,48.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[102.0,0.0,198.0,96.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[266.0,0.0,270.0,96.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[102.0,0.0,198.0,96.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[266.0,0.0,270.0,96.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[134.0,310.0,230.0,314.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[134.0,310.0,230.0,314.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"872b7c46-0143-5fca-8c68-25b972991bd1"},{"name":"scr_w0_w","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":f